# HakiOS fragment: the OnePlus 6T (fajita, devices/oneplus-6t) -- what is true of this phone and of no other with the same SoC.
# No CONFIG_HAPTIC: the PMI8998's haptics block is not one of the kernel's variants yet. No CONFIG_MODEM_BUFFER: the phone's
# device tree gives the rmtfs buffer no fixed address (qcom,rmtfs_sharedmem reg <0 0x200000>, placed at run time).
CONFIG_DEVICE="fajita"
